WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Hello everyone. My name is Vladimir, and I am a top leader with Atomy. Today I want to tell you about our remarkable product, HemoHIM. HemoHIM is our company’s flagship product and a unique offering from Atomy. For the past seven years, HemoHIM has been the No. 1 product in its category in South Korea, and it continues to gain recognition and respect around the world. So, what is HemoHIM in brief?

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:55.000
HemoHIM is a functional dietary supplement, a form of functional nutrition. HemoHIM is one of the key secrets behind the success not only of our team, but of Atomy leaders worldwide. Why? Because HemoHIM cleanses the blood, strengthens blood cells and supports the immune system. As a result, you feel better and can pursue your plans and goals because you have more energy — and more energy can lead to better results.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:22.000
My first encounter with this product was quite skeptical. After reading all the descriptions and reviews, I did not fully believe them. I doubted that everything people were saying was really true. But putting my skepticism aside, I decided to try the product. At first, I did not notice any result. Then I realized that my sleep quality had improved, I started feeling rested more quickly, and I stopped yawning during the day.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Overall, I had more energy. I stopped getting tired at work, and when I came home, I still wanted to do something else. After three years of using this product, I can confidently say that I believe it is suitable for everyone because it cleanses the blood and strengthens the immune system. Based on my personal observations, I stopped getting sick while using this product.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:15.000
Even a threat such as coronavirus passed for us in just a couple of days without any complications. And from the example of many people, I see how HemoHIM helps them deal with different situations, including chronic, severe and extremely acute illnesses. But even if you are not ill, that does not mean you do not need HemoHIM. As I said, I believe HemoHIM is suitable for everyone because it helps cleanse blood cells and strengthen the immune system.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:44.000
In this way, it makes you healthier and helps you become a better version of yourself. If you doubt whether HemoHIM works or whether you need it, stop doubting and give it a try, just as I once did. We are often asked about the secret behind our success and strong results, and HemoHIM is definitely one of the main elements behind that success, because we would not be able to work as much as we do without it.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:03:09.000
This product was developed at the request of the South Korean government to support the health and immune system of employees at the Atomic Energy Research Institute. Today, HemoHIM is showing remarkable results around the world. Some people are afraid to use a dietary supplement because they do not know what it contains. They worry that it might cause harm or lead to dependence.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:36.000
But HemoHIM consists entirely of natural organic ingredients and, in my view, cannot cause harm because it is made from herbs and vitamins. HemoHIM combines the centuries-old wisdom of Eastern medicine with advanced and innovative South Korean technology, giving us a product that can be used every day. Wherever we go and whatever we do, HemoHIM is always with us — especially in difficult times such as the pandemic.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:55.000
HemoHIM has proven to be a reliable companion and helper for me in business and in maintaining a healthy lifestyle. I recommend that everyone try this product and judge it from personal experience. Trust our story and the stories of thousands, even hundreds of thousands, of people around the world. Thank you for your attention. This was Vladimir Khigay. See you again soon.
